        {
          "text": "Mana mushilo eshio malaika wOMWAMI yarula, nakhupa abandu ebikhumila eshikhumi namakhumi munaane nabiraano mukambi yabaAshuru; nolwa abandu babuukha mumabwibwi, lola mbabo, nemilambo chionyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
