        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olundi olwa yali niyeenaame munzu yaNisirokhi nyasayewe, abaanabe Adaramelekhu nende Sharezari bamurema nolukanga, nafwa; nibeehonokokha nibatsia mushialo shiaArarati. Naye Esarihadoni omwanawe yaruka mushilenjeshie.",
